# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE AI STUDIO GEMINI API FLEET CONFIGURATION (.env.fleet.gemini)
# ==============================================================================
# INSTRUCTIONS & SETUP:
# 1. Sign in to Google AI Studio: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# 2. Click "Create API Key".
#
# CRITICAL QUIRKS & PITFALLS:
# - [QUIRK 1 - PROJECT QUOTA MULTIPLIER]:
#   Google AI Studio quotas (15 RPM, 1M TPM, 1,500 RPD on free tier) are enforced
#   PER GOOGLE CLOUD PROJECT, NOT per API key!
#   * If you create 5 keys in the SAME project, they all share ONE 15 RPM bucket.
#   * To achieve TRUE MULTIPLIED CAPACITY (e.g., 10 keys = 150 RPM, 15,000 RPD),
#     choose "Create API key in a new project" for each key you generate!
#
# - [QUIRK 2 - WORKSPACE / SCHOOL ACCOUNTS]:
#   Google Workspace for Education or enterprise accounts frequently block AI Studio
#   ("Generative AI access disabled by administrator"). Personal @gmail.com accounts
#   work instantly with zero setup and no credit card required.
#
# - [QUIRK 3 - MODEL IDENTIFIERS]:
#   Use modern Gemini models:
#   * gemini-3.8-flash       (Default, high-throughput, balanced speed & reasoning)
#   * gemini-3.1-pro-preview (Deep reasoning, complex architectural synthesis)
#   * gemini-3.5-flash-lite  (Ultra-low latency, fast classification)
#   (Legacy models gemini-1.5-* / 2.0-* / 2.5-* are auto-mapped by the fleet adapter).
#
# - [QUIRK 4 - TWO-TIER RATE LIMIT RESILIENCE]:
#   The Fleet rotator automatically handles:
#   * Tier 1 (Burst Cooldown): 60-120s cooldown on HTTP 429 / RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED.
#   * Tier 2 (Daily Exhaustion): Cooldown until 00:00 UTC midnight.
#   Requests automatically failover transparently to the next available healthy key.
# ==============================================================================

# Fleet runtime settings
GEMINI_DEFAULT_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
GEMINI_BURST_COOLDOWN_SEC=60
GEMINI_MAX_RETRIES=3

# ==============================================================================
# GEMINI API KEY ROSTER (PASTE YOUR KEYS BELOW)
# ==============================================================================
# Add as many keys as you have (from different projects / accounts).
# The rotator automatically discovers GEMINI_API_KEY_1 .. GEMINI_API_KEY_N.

GEMINI_API_KEY_1=
GEMINI_API_KEY_2=
GEMINI_API_KEY_3=
